This split was frozen on 2026-09-09 after Phase 1. Per plan.md,
do not regenerate or edit data/splits.json (or the seed-to-split
assignment in make_splits.py) until Phase 7's final run. Phase 2
decomposer training uses train only; Phase 3 recall@5 evaluation
uses a separate held-out requirement->passage set, not these
task splits; Phase 5 bandit training/eval uses train/val only.
